msgid ""
msgstr ""
"# Roadmap Guide\n"
"\n"
"This document provides a detailed guide on how to use the roadmap feature. The roadmap is a visual tool designed to help you plan and track project progress. It displays tasks and milestones on a timeline, allowing you to clearly understand the project schedule and dependencies.\n"
"\n"
"## Accessing the Roadmap\n"
"\n"
"1. Log in to your project management account.\n"
"2. Navigate to the project you wish to view.\n"
"3. Click on the \"Roadmap\" tab in the top navigation bar.\n"
"\n"
"## Roadmap Interface Overview\n"
"\n"
"The roadmap interface consists of the following main areas:\n"
"\n"
"- **Timeline View**: Displays tasks and milestones chronologically.\n"
"- **Task List**: Shows all tasks in the project, with their start dates, end dates, and progress.\n"
"- **Milestone Markers**: Indicate important project milestones.\n"
"- **Dependency Lines**: Show the dependencies between tasks.\n"
"\n"
"## Creating and Managing Tasks\n"
"\n"
"### Creating a New Task\n"
"\n"
"1. Click the \"Add Task\" button in the top right corner of the roadmap.\n"
"2. Fill in the task name, description, start date, and end date.\n"
"3. Assign the task to a team member.\n"
"4. Set task priority and tags.\n"
"5. Click \"Save\" to create the task.\n"
"\n"
"### Editing a Task\n"
"\n"
"1. Click on the task you wish to edit.\n"
"2. Modify the task details as needed.\n"
"3. Click \"Save\" to apply the changes.\n"
"\n"
"### Deleting a Task\n"
"\n"
"1. Click on the task you wish to delete.\n"
"2. Click the \"Delete\" button in the task details panel.\n"
"3. Confirm the deletion.\n"
"\n"
"## Managing Milestones\n"
"\n"
"### Creating a Milestone\n"
"\n"
"1. Click the \"Add Milestone\" button in the top right corner of the roadmap.\n"
"2. Enter the milestone name and date.\n"
"3. Click \"Save\" to create the milestone.\n"
"\n"
"### Editing a Milestone\n"
"\n"
"1. Click on the milestone you wish to edit.\n"
"2. Modify the milestone details.\n"
"3. Click \"Save\" to apply the changes.\n"
"\n"
"### Deleting a Milestone\n"
"\n"
"1. Click on the milestone you wish to delete.\n"
"2. Click the \"Delete\" button in the milestone details panel.\n"
"3. Confirm the deletion.\n"
"\n"
"## Setting Task Dependencies\n"
"\n"
"1. Click on the task you wish to set dependencies for.\n"
"2. In the task details panel, find the \"Dependencies\" section.\n"
"3. Click \"Add Dependency\" and select the task that must be completed before this task.\n"
"4. Click \"Save\" to apply the dependency.\n"
"\n"
"## Filtering and Searching\n"
"\n"
"- Use the filter bar at the top of the roadmap to filter tasks by status, priority, assignee, or tags.\n"
"- Use the search box to quickly locate specific tasks or milestones.\n"
"\n"
"## Exporting the Roadmap\n"
"\n"
"1. Click the \"Export\" button in the top right corner of the roadmap.\n"
"2. Choose the export format (e.g., PDF, PNG, or CSV).\n"
"3. Follow the prompts to complete the export.\n"
"\n"
"## Tips and Best Practices\n"
"\n"
"- Regularly update task progress to keep the roadmap accurate.\n"
"- Use milestones to mark key project phases.\n"
"- Set dependencies to clarify task order and avoid conflicts.\n"
"- Review the roadmap regularly to ensure the project is on track.\n"
"\n"
"By following this guide, you will be able to effectively use the roadmap feature to plan and manage your projects. If you have any questions, please refer to the FAQ section or contact our support team.\n"

msgid "Roadmap指导"
msgstr "Roadmap Guide"

msgid "使用 GitHub Issue 来跟踪和管理各组织的计划及中长期目标。本文档为社区项目编写路线图类 Issue 提供参考和规范，以帮助创建和维护高质量的路线图。"
msgstr "Use GitHub Issues to track and manage the plans and mid-to-long-term goals of each organization. This document provides reference and guidelines for community projects to write roadmap-type Issues, aiming to help create and maintain high-quality roadmaps."

msgid "下面是一个完整的路线图 Issue 示例，展示了所有推荐元素的实际应用。建议先查看此示例获得整体印象，再阅读后续的详细规范说明。"
msgstr "Below is a complete roadmap issue example, demonstrating the practical application of all recommended elements. It is advisable to first review this example to gain an overall impression, and then read the subsequent detailed specification explanations."

msgid "创建 Issue 标题：[Roadmap] Triton-Ascend Roadmap 2026 Q2\\n"
msgstr "Create Issue title: [Roadmap] Triton-Ascend Roadmap 2026 Q2"

msgid "1. 标题格式"
msgstr "1\\. Heading Format"

msgid "**格式：** `[Roadmap] <Project Name> Roadmap <Time Range>`，季度发布使用 Q1/Q2/Q3/Q4 标记，半年度发布使用 H1/H2 标记"
msgstr "**Format:** `[Roadmap] <Project Name> Roadmap <Time Range>`, quarterly releases use Q1/Q2/Q3/Q4 markers, semi-annual releases use H1/H2 markers."

msgid "**示例：**"
msgstr "**Example:**"

msgid "`[Roadmap] Triton-Ascend Roadmap 2026 Q2`"
msgstr "[Roadmap] Triton-Ascend Roadmap 2026 Q2"

msgid "`[Roadmap] Triton-Ascend Roadmap 2026 H1`"
msgstr "[Roadmap] Triton-Ascend Roadmap 2026 H1"

msgid "2. 顶层内容"
msgstr "2\\. Top-level Content"

msgid "2.1 开篇描述（可选）"
msgstr "2.1 Opening Description (Optional)"

msgid "提供项目概述、愿景或整体方向的简要总结。例如，简要描述 Triton-Ascend 本季度在上游对齐、后端性能和算子覆盖方面的目标。"
msgstr "Provide a brief summary of the project overview, vision, or overall direction. For example, briefly describe Triton-Ascend's goals for this quarter in terms of upstream alignment, backend performance, and operator coverage."

msgid "2.2 重点方向章节"
msgstr "2.2 Key Focus Areas Section"

msgid "列出本周期最关键的 3-5 个重点方向，建议按项目的**功能领域**或**技术模块**分组，覆盖全局视角："
msgstr "List the 3-5 most critical focus areas for this cycle, recommended to be grouped by the project's **functional domains** or **technical modules**, covering a global perspective:"

msgid "## Focus\\n"
msgstr "## Focus"

msgid "**特征：**"
msgstr "**Features:**"

msgid "高层次概括和描述当前周期项目的主要开发方向，无需详细展开"
msgstr "High-level summary and description of the main development directions for the current cycle's project, without the need for detailed elaboration."

msgid "3. 主要功能模块章节"
msgstr "3\\. Main Functional Modules Section"

msgid "3.1 章节划分原则"
msgstr "3.1 Chapter Division Principles"

msgid "按项目的**功能领域**或**技术模块**分组，例如："
msgstr "Group by the project's **functional areas** or **technical modules**, for example:"

msgid "**Upstream Compatibility** - Upstream Triton frontend and IR alignment"
msgstr "**Upstream Compatibility** - Alignment with upstream Triton frontend and IR"

msgid "**Backend Performance** - Ascend NPU backend kernel generation and memory optimization"
msgstr "**Backend Performance** - Ascend NPU backend kernel generation and memory optimization"

msgid "**Operator Coverage** - Triton built-in ops and dtype support on Ascend"
msgstr "**Operator Coverage** - Triton built-in ops and dtype support on Ascend"

msgid "**Usability** - Debugging tools and error reporting"
msgstr "**可用性** - 调试工具与错误报告"

msgid "**Ecosystem Integration** - Integration with training/inference frameworks"
msgstr "**Ecosystem Integration** - Integration with training/inference frameworks"

msgid "3.2 各模块结构"
msgstr "3.2 Module Structures"

msgid "每个模块包含多个**具体工作项**，格式如下："
msgstr "Each module contains multiple **specific work items**, formatted as follows:"

msgid "## [Module Name]\\n"
msgstr "## [Module Name]"

msgid "4. 关键元数据字段"
msgstr "4\\. Key Metadata Fields"

msgid "每个工作项应包含以下关键信息："
msgstr "Each work item should include the following key information:"

msgid "4.1 目标（Goal）"
msgstr "4.1 Goal"

msgid "**含义**：工作目标或简要描述"
msgstr "**Meaning**: Work objective or brief description"

msgid "**用法**：说明该工作项的目标"
msgstr "**Usage**: Describes the objective of this work item."

msgid "**示例**：`目标：在昇腾后端 tl.dot 中支持 FP8（E4M3/E5M2）数据类型`"
msgstr "**Example**: `Goal: Support FP8 (E4M3/E5M2) data types in tl.dot on the Ascend backend`"

msgid "4.2 负责人（Owner）"
msgstr "4.2 Owner"

msgid "**含义**：责任人"
msgstr "**Meaning**: Responsible Person"

msgid "**格式**：`负责人：@GitHubID`"
msgstr "**Format**: `Lead: @GitHubID`"

msgid "**用法**：明确谁负责或主导该工作项"
msgstr "**Usage**: Clearly indicate who is responsible for or leads the work item."

msgid "**示例**：`负责人：@contributor-a`"
msgstr "**Example**: `Lead: @contributor-a`"

msgid "4.3 Issue"
msgstr "4.3 Issue"

msgid "**含义**：关联的 GitHub Issue"
msgstr "**Meaning**: Linked GitHub Issue"

msgid "**格式**：`Issue：<Issue 链接>`"
msgstr "**Format**: `Issue: <Issue link>`"

msgid "**用法**：跟踪详细设计和讨论"
msgstr "**Usage**: Track detailed design and discussion."

msgid "**示例**：`Issue：https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/issues`"
msgstr "**Example**: `Issue: https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/issues`"

msgid "4.4 PR（Pull Request）"
msgstr "4.4 PR (Pull Request)"

msgid "**含义**：相关实现 PR"
msgstr "**Meaning**: Related implementation PR"

msgid "**格式**：`PR：<PR 链接>`"
msgstr "**Format**: `PR: <PR link>`"

msgid "**用法**：关联实现工作"
msgstr "**Usage**: Link implementation work"

msgid "**示例**：`PR：https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/pulls`"
msgstr "**Example**: `PR: https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/pulls`"

msgid "5. 可选补充内容"
msgstr "5\\. Optional supplementary content"

msgid "5.1 🙋 欢迎贡献标记"
msgstr "5.1 🙋 Welcome Contribution Markers"

msgid "对于特别欢迎社区开发者贡献的工作项，建议使用 **[🙋 欢迎贡献]** 标记来标识："
msgstr "For work items that particularly welcome contributions from community developers, it is recommended to use the **[🙋 Welcome Contributions]** tag to mark them."

msgid "- [ ] **FP8 dtype and mixed-precision ops support [🙋 Help Wanted]**\\n"
msgstr "- [ ] **FP8 dtype and mixed-precision ops support [🙋 Help Wanted]**"

msgid "5.2 子 Issue"
msgstr "5.2 Sub-issues"

msgid "在路线图 Issue 底部列出跨周期的相关路线图 Issue 或大工作项的分解 Issue。"
msgstr "List related cross-cycle roadmap issues or breakdown issues of large work items at the bottom of the roadmap issue."

msgid "**与工作项中 Issue 字段的区别：**"
msgstr "**Difference from the Issue field in work items:**"

msgid "**工作项中的 Issue 字段**：链接到该工作项的具体设计、讨论或跟踪 Issue"
msgstr "**Issue fields in work items**: Link to the specific design, discussion, or tracking Issue for that work item."

msgid "**子 Issue 章节**：用于关联其他周期的路线图 Issue（如上季度未完成的工作），或将大工作项分解为多个独立跟踪的子 Issue"
msgstr "**Sub-issue Section**: Used to link roadmap issues from other periods (such as unfinished work from the previous quarter), or to break down large work items into multiple independently tracked sub-issues."

msgid "## Sub-issues\\n"
msgstr "## Sub-issues"
